#: ../../whatsnew/3.3.rst:1069
msgid ""
":class:`curses.window` has a new :attr:`curses.window.encoding` attribute."
msgstr ""
":class:`curses.window` hat ein neues Attribut :attr:`curses.window.encoding`."

