"of :meth:`importlib.abc.SourceLoader.path_stats` as bytecode files now store "
"both the modification time and size of the source file the bytecode file was "
"compiled from."
msgstr ""
":meth:`importlib.abc.SourceLoader.path_mtime` ist nun zugunsten "
"von :meth:`importlib.abc.SourceLoader.path_stats` veraltet, da Bytecode-"
