#: ../../whatsnew/3.3.rst:2441
msgid ""
"The undocumented internal helper class ``SSLFakeFile`` has been removed "
"from :mod:`smtplib`, since its functionality has long been provided directly "
"by :meth:`socket.socket.makefile`."
msgstr ""
